<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia closing January coffee registrations.</title>
<headline>Colombia closing January coffee registrations.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's National Coffee Growers' Federation said it was closing January coffee registrations for shipments by private exporters as of Jan 17.</p>
<p>Registrations for shipments by Federation exporters were already closed on Jan 10.</p>
<p>The Federation also announced that registrations for March shipments by all exporters would open Jan 20.</p>
<p>Private exporters will be limited to total shipments of no more than 420,000 60-kg bags in March, the Federation said.</p>
<p>((--Tom Brown, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
